# The default sc bridge for every Chat card on this board: a server that runs the `sc`
# (simple-ai-chat) CLI and exposes it over HTTP, e.g. http://10.0.0.2:8787. It is not part of
# this board — the board only points at it. A single card can point somewhere else with
# `bridgeUrl` in its own config (the Edit button), which wins over this.
# See the Chat section of the module README for the two endpoints the card uses.
VITE_SC_BRIDGE_URL=
